# ΓöÇΓöÇ ShadowStack Environment Variables (Template) ΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇ
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values.
# Base URL for the ShadowStack API backend
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000/api/v1

# Polling interval in milliseconds (default: 30000 = 30 seconds)
VITE_POLLING_INTERVAL_MS=30000

# GitHub OAuth App Client ID (required for login)
VITE_GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=your_github_oauth_app_client_id

